# Deeply chained access with get builtin calls
[
  data: [
    0: [name: "first"]
    1: [name: "second"]
  ]
  result: [get "name" [get 1 data]]
]
=== out
Dict({"data": Dict({0: Dict({"name": ...}), 1: Dict({"name": ...})}), "result": String("second")})
=== warn
undefined variable: get at 6:12-6:15
